{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261012/photo/bkn-20261012130148401-1012_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261012132752\"/><p>尚智樓有人墮樓。</p><p>將軍澳有人墮樓。今午(12日)12時48分，途人報案，指一名男子倒臥在唐明街2號尚德邨尚智樓對開，懷疑他從高處墮下。救護車接報到場，將昏迷事主急送將軍澳醫院搶救，男子身份及墮樓原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:57.479382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T08:38:02.475795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:56.159026+00:00","content_hash":"813d63e2615e3a83b563da1a1bb8d35946da46e6665bb06c8c971ef369c12f5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}